  "title": "Zuppa Di Pesce Fra Di Avolo",
  "description": "Zuppa di pesce is a rustic Italian seafood stew packed with shellfish, tomatoes, and herbs. This version spices things up with red chili flakes.",
  "authors": [
    "Charles Anthony"
  ],
